  "keyFeatures": [
    "JWT authentication with RSA-256 key pairs and refresh token support",
    "Role-based access control (ADMIN and COLABORADOR roles)",
    "Geographic matching algorithm using Google Maps Routes API to pair beneficiaries with nearest available dentist",
    "Address enrichment via ViaCEP REST client integration",
    "Paginated responses with a generic PageResponse<T> envelope",
    "In-memory caching with Quarkus Cache (Caffeine) and write-through invalidation",
    "CSV export for beneficiaries, dentists, and appointments",
    "Oracle Database persistence with Hibernate ORM + Panache",
    "285 unit tests with JUnit 5, Mockito 5, AssertJ and JaCoCo coverage",
    "Docker support with JVM and GraalVM native image Dockerfiles",
    "Azure Pipelines CI/CD pipeline deploying to Azure App Service"
  ],
